## Rule Configuration

### Review Scope Options
- **changed-files**: Review only git-modified files (default)
- **staged-files**: Review only git-staged files
- **branch-diff**: Review diff against main/master branch
- **full-codebase**: Review entire codebase (explicit request only)

### Severity Filters
- **critical-only**: Show only critical issues
- **major-and-above**: Show critical and major issues
- **all**: Show all issues including minor and enhancements

### File Type Focus
- **components-only**: Focus on .tsx component files
- **styles-only**: Focus on .scss style files
- **docs-only**: Focus on documentation files
- **all-types**: Review all file types

